  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continuing the promotion, dissemination, and implementation of the Recommendation on the Ethics of AI, specially by completing the methodological instruments conceived by UNESCO (RAM, EIA) and presenting and discussing its results with multiple stakeholders in Cuba, Dominican Republic and Venezuela.

